From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rezoss <rezoss@unica.local>
Date: Wed, 17 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Use S26U device model for SCS requests

SIVS sends the device model in the SCS/SIS metadata headers. Keep the
spoof scoped to the SamsungIntelliVoiceServices request path used by
Now Brief custom-card generation instead of changing global build props.

diff --git a/smali/com/samsung/android/intellivoiceservice/common/connection/server/LlmClientInterceptor.smali b/smali/com/samsung/android/intellivoiceservice/common/connection/server/LlmClientInterceptor.smali
--- a/smali/com/samsung/android/intellivoiceservice/common/connection/server/LlmClientInterceptor.smali
+++ b/smali/com/samsung/android/intellivoiceservice/common/connection/server/LlmClientInterceptor.smali
@@ -209,10 +209,6 @@

     move-result-object v3

-    sget-object v4, Landroid/os/Build;->MODEL:Ljava/lang/String;
-
-    invoke-static {v4}, Ljava/lang/String;->valueOf(Ljava/lang/Object;)Ljava/lang/String;
-
-    move-result-object v4
+    const-string v4, "SM-S928B"

     const-string v5, "device-model"
